{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_title", "source_sha256": "a43a00399f2a138eb24c0383f1eec4b9502ce40a0b9c2f761a45ec9f085ce3b6", "ja": "ふたりのファッションショー", "zh": "两人的时装秀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a1cc0398d9bbb5de7bbb8048cfa25c55f9ad8e684c70f97cd1fd0948d8455878", "ja": "765プロのライバル事務所、\n961プロ所属のアイドル、詩花と玲音。\n劇場の衣装を着る事になり、試着を楽しむ\nふたりの、にぎやかな一幕です。", "zh": "765艺能的对手事务所，\n961艺能旗下的偶像诗花与玲音。\n决定试穿剧场的服装，并享受试衣乐趣的\n两人，热闹非凡的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "bbee0304f46eb76d1f99792680f9c2163f6d7e2a0b92235c51d941ac94612f7d", "ja": "―ある日の公演前―", "zh": "―某天演出前―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1001_202xxx", "source_sha256": "61ab163765f72b18f8888cb170c510a161e6a2ca0f5ba6c4228972110f2d40e6", "ja": "相変わらず、765プロのプロデューサーは面白い事を\n考えるよね。今から客席の反応が楽しみだ！", "zh": "一如既往，765Pro的制作人总能想出有意思的点子呢。真期待观众席会有什么反应啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1002_201xxx", "source_sha256": "35bcf288266cd572dcd3583559a1eef4486cec595d9dc4984cf0f00d1d82d570", "ja": "ゲストの私たちが、皆さんとお揃いの衣装で登場する\nなんて……。きっと喜んでもらえますよね♪", "zh": "我们这些嘉宾穿着和大家一样的服装登场……大家一定会很开心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1003_202xxx", "source_sha256": "4d7cc61c450654f10cccc253237fcb4d73046706c1375b7ecc5c87023a106aa1", "ja": "で、この衣装は、和洋折衷がテーマなのかな。\nうん、ちゃんとまとまってる。着心地もいいよ！", "zh": "话说，这套服装的主题是日西合璧吗？  \n嗯，整体搭配得很协调。穿起来也很舒服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1004_201xxx", "source_sha256": "9f86533339faf6afca72da33d02e0f542ebe8c41db72ee4524d321ed51f335f6", "ja": "きらびやかですよねっ。\nお姉さまがますますゴージャスに見えます！", "zh": "真是华丽夺目呢！\n姐姐看起来更加雍容华贵了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1005_202xxx", "source_sha256": "24e3afc4eda726b903b1ac73856c6ceba306a89dd3fae3a7ba0e4ace7cacb31f", "ja": "そういう詩花も、よく似合ってるよ。\nキミの可憐さがいつも以上に引き立ってる。", "zh": "诗花，你这样也很合适哦。  \n你的可爱比平时更加突出了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1006_201xxx", "source_sha256": "ab4325f9a1035f8dc1005d4c5058255310fe46c7dae896a6ea3b8ef7ba2499a7", "ja": "ありがとうございます♪　私も、こういうの大好きで。\nあ、私たちも作ってみませんか？　可愛い衣装！", "zh": "谢谢♪　我也很喜欢这样的。\n啊，要不我们也做一套吧？做一套可爱的服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1007_202xxx", "source_sha256": "ba26c30e85cf86132b2a265341eef58ea71bb52cbb0a3733e506a9b5ce0264d1", "ja": "いいね、採用！　あとでデザイナーに\nコンタクトを取るよ。さて、次は……。", "zh": "不错，采纳了！回头我就去联系\n设计师。那么，接下来是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1008_202xxx", "source_sha256": "b25051681c4b675f0f90363065596c76702efa08243a257c18e204a679ec7945", "ja": "これはなかなか、先鋭的なデザインだね。\nNYでもウケるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "这个设计相当先锋呢。在纽约也会大受欢迎吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1009_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6befe543a14821f6fec6b96b9fa9c5fafe545dd54eb0300bba5d544a6a60a7c8", "ja": "765プロの衣装って、意外と挑戦的ですよね。\nこの衣装も……。", "zh": "765事务所的服装，意外地很有挑战性呢。\n这套服装也是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1010_201xxx", "source_sha256": "5d3e5bd9811794c56af186e1edb38eb5b08c1c90d94fd0c1fcbe638543c61081", "ja": "ただの水着といえば、そうなんですけど……。\nあの……私、大丈夫ですか！？", "zh": "要说是普通的泳装，确实没错……  \n那个……我这样真的没问题吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1011_202xxx", "source_sha256": "e4bf24e2d992b0e3658853ceda07d6aecff472712d70d5766e611323b4b641c3", "ja": "大丈夫、エクセレントだ！　詩花の新しい魅力を\n発見した気分だね。さあ、どんどん行こう！", "zh": "没问题，棒极了！感觉发现了诗花新的\n魅力呢。来，继续拍下一套吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1012_202xxx", "source_sha256": "c81daa0d34ff9470fc3ac58dbe90cabb23a657e1ce9f22fdff118cb04f239a61", "ja": "うん、ゴシックでカワイイ感じ！\nあははっ、こういうの着たの何年ぶりかな？", "zh": "嗯，有种哥特式的可爱感觉！\n啊哈哈，我都多少年没穿过这种风格了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1013_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1b1e7622d828c6a368b2ebeae6f28d356891351809f91efce92b4bfe41869289", "ja": "とってもよくお似合いですよ！\nお姉さまも、新しい魅力を発見ですね♪", "zh": "非常适合您呢！\n姐姐也发现了全新的魅力呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1014_202xxx", "source_sha256": "db5163b8ad347b8ba72c861206c03d47bce2006090796c3737955611c2593915", "ja": "詩花のは、一気に季節感を変えるよね。\nうん、可愛いプレゼントって感じだ！　あとは……。", "zh": "诗花的这套，一下子就让季节感完全变了呢。嗯，感觉就像一份可爱的礼物！然后还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1015_202xxx", "source_sha256": "3fe45b779eb189cc6246041d2d88ce660bf3deddaa18a6a0776a3b909eb45f5b", "ja": "……うん、なるほど。\nただのステージ衣装だけど、なんだかくすぐったいな。", "zh": "……嗯，原来如此。\n虽然只是普通的舞台服装，但总觉得有点不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1016_201xxx", "source_sha256": "a9f3ef1aca843e1ad25614b3a9585adf77dfab3d630007c8ba0139e90657c800", "ja": "ステキ！　お姉さまステキですっ！\n私、なんていうかこう……胸がいっぱいです！", "zh": "好棒！姐姐大人好棒！\n我、该怎么说呢……心里满满的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1017_202xxx", "source_sha256": "e17b268bbedab01a7af7ce16e603d612693f00bdb3a646ff2d15ac64cd3fb110", "ja": "でも、アタシは詩花に着てほしかったのにな。\nどうせ着るんだから、恥ずかしがっても仕方ないよ？", "zh": "不过，我本来是想让诗花穿的呢。\n反正你迟早要穿，害羞也没用吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1018_201xxx", "source_sha256": "c0e709d7f3f8a278d68927a1fb60b22f702bc6c960777b7a7a5403f8617d991d", "ja": "そ、そうなんですけど……\nまだ、心の準備が……。", "zh": "是、是这样没错……\n可是，我还没做好心理准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1019_202xxx", "source_sha256": "6e930d53a5ba4f9df4958815e8a7e187b153016e11d535aae2bf7b969351af9c", "ja": "ま、いいけど。さて、次はさっき詩花が着てた水着、\nアタシも着てみようっと♪", "zh": "好吧，也行。那接下来，我也试试刚才诗花穿的泳装♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_1020_202xxx", "source_sha256": "e6b167b79e313f5db6632cfa61df7c5127251e41f5b61dc8ff85fcb51e297024", "ja": "そうだ！　次はさっき詩花が着てた水着、\nアタシも着てみようっと♪", "zh": "对了！接下来，我也要试试刚才诗花穿的那件泳装♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2000_201xxx", "source_sha256": "b8a483740c4cb09ee8a399708402417baed439a33f542dba2996521d095492fb", "ja": "あ、さっきのセーラーミズギですね。お姉さまのは……\nえっ、お姉さまがセーラーミズギを！？", "zh": "啊，是刚才那件水手泳装吧。姐姐大人的那件是……\n诶，姐姐大人要穿水手泳装！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2001_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2002_p", "source_sha256": "902cce45096ecf00b80b5c6936c7e07d7fbdb8884efec3547ff742507315b674", "ja": "二人とも、試着お疲れ様！\nうちの衣装はどうだった？", "zh": "两位，试穿辛苦啦！\n我们这边的服装感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2003_202xxx", "source_sha256": "1811967d647f094f5b681fccf03ce2502f7785d629ade651a161c7c2e8d9cd3e", "ja": "すっごく面白かった！　あんなに楽しい試着は、\n初めてかも。どの衣装も個性的だよね！", "zh": "特别有意思！这么开心的试穿体验，可能还是第一次。每套服装都很有个性呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2004_201xxx", "source_sha256": "1a64e2d92430ddb7acc49fe8c5b06efdf5e1fa7e1dfd271ebbd0cfed2511731b", "ja": "着替えるだけで、表現したいことも全然変わって。\nやっぱり衣装は大切なんですね。勉強になりました♪", "zh": "只要换上不同的衣服，想要表达的内容也会完全改变。果然，服装真的很重要呢。学到了不少♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2005_p", "source_sha256": "4729fcd963d1b56906daeb5e6b491a2e8d74c98843cdd9e23ae874929a3eeacc", "ja": "こちらこそ、二人にはいつも勉強させてもらってるよ。\nこれからも、引き続きよろしく！", "zh": "我才要谢谢你们，一直以来都是你们让我学到了很多。今后也请继续多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2006_202xxx", "source_sha256": "d90c3b71f7d677d09d44dc431b1aee0fc108f2f83de336665c7a6ad13708286e", "ja": "ああ、まずは今日の公演だ。\nオーディエンスに最高のサプライズを届けよう！", "zh": "啊，首先要把今天的公演做好。\n给观众带来最棒的惊喜吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_402_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_402_cc_01_2007_201xxx", "source_sha256": "6df90d684e29529ddeeef18eb31118a77d718b49e51b60e0e904ac79b024b528", "ja": "私も、早く皆さんとお揃いの衣装で、ステージに\n立ちたいなって。これからも、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "我也想快点穿上和大家一样的服装，站上舞台。今后也请多多关照♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
